  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">Chipped</h1>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BAscRYKm/images/cbbeeca232f2632aef4ac4856f80c2e7566a4461.png\" alt=\"Chipped\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/I80VLV.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"由 Terrarium 製作\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fresourceful-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/jUWHY2.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Resourceful Lib\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/TNilje.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"需要 Athena\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p>你曾經想過用大型砂岩磚建造一座史詩般的城堡嗎？或者也許你想用純粹的瑪格納石打造一座下界要塞？又或者你只是想用泥土蓋間小屋，或是用大名鼎鼎的花崗閃長岩面孔製成圖騰柱？無論如何，我們都能滿足你的需求！</p>\n<p>Chipped 是一款適用於 1.16+ 版本的建築模組，大幅擴充了遊戲內可使用的方塊種類。本模組提供超過 11,000 種獨特的建築方塊，從染色玻璃變體一直到混凝土、海晶石，甚至是鍍金黑石都有！不僅所有紋理皆以原版風格手工繪製，更支援大量連通紋理，由&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fathena-ctm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Athena</a>驅動！</p>\n<p>靈感源自熱門模組 Chisel，Chipped 讓建造者能充分發揮創意，因為每個方塊都值得擁有夥伴！</p>\n<p>要開始使用非常簡單，只需合成七種工作台之一即可。這些工作台能讓你將各種原版方塊轉換為碎磚變體。雖然它們的外觀各不相同，但操作方式完全一樣，因此你可以挑選最適合你建築風格的那一款，或是製作幾種不同的工作台分散擺放在基地裡。無論你有什麼構想，Chipped 都能幫你將其化為現實！</p>\n<br>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r9FApKUUDnE?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<h4>程式開發：</h4>\nGrim, Alex Nijjar, MsRandom1, CodexAdrian, ThatGravyBoat\n<h4>美術設計：</h4>\nKekie6, Marc-IceBlade, Shrimp, Facu, Frogipher, SunsetSoup, Valilla, Brother Earth, Joosh, ArtistMonster, Zilver</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/514923/description_c1dc4fb6-bae9-4212-a47f-d7a3a4dea600.jpg\" alt=\"與好友同樂的最佳方式。使用 Essential Mod 一起遊玩\" width=\"837\" height=\"164\"></a></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">✨社群連結✨<br><br></h3>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutube.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/youtube-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/terrariumearth\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitch\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftwitter.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitter-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkofi.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terrarium.earth%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTerrarium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/terrariumearth/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Q6cN4uw.png\" alt=\"分隔線\"></div>\n<h3>探索我們的其它專案<br><br></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fhandcrafted\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/9DjUsr.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"手工模組\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fchipped\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/lRunun.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Chipped\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fad-astra\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/snZW6z.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Ad Astra\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252ftempad\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/HPp8Fo.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Tempad\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fspirit\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/SQ4Me7.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"彩色杜鵑花\" width=\"96\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fargonauts\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/05PfzF.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"小翅膀\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcadmus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/YqZ7Hf.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"Vitalize\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fheracles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/RzlEoy.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"靈魂\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fprometheus\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://images.teamresourceful.com/u/DP8PUz.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"收割者\" width=\"96\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modrinth.com%252fmod%252fcommon-storage-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=http://images.teamresourceful.com/u/wP2ReQ.svg&n=-1\" alt=\"經驗方尖碑\" width=\"96\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"display:inline\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
